    "updated_at": "2015-11-14T15:53:23Z",
    "body": "Relevant use counters:\n- [InputTypeDateTimeFallback](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/29) for when `type=datetime` falls back to the behavior of `type=text`.\n- [InputTypeDateTimeLocal](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/30) for `type=datetime-local`.\n\nBoth are counted only when the computed style is is not `visibility:hidden`. (Not sure why, there are many other ways to not be visible.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
