    "body": "https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/FAQ#Is_there_a_process_for_removing_bad_ideas_from_a_specification.3F should explain the rationale. Basically, if something is not implemented and there is no desire to implement, we remove it. This happens at times. We've started being a lot more careful about adding new features though, so it should happen less going forward.\n",
